  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Grease a 1L (4 cup) baking dish. Thinly slice the onion. Coarsely grate the carrots. Coarsely grate the haloumi.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2620360/photos/large/136257_1-6430b35136fb6fb9b7f7e10378715a8b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prep rosti: Whisk 1 egg in a large bowl. Add the onion, carrot, haloumi, cumin and coriander spice blend and 75g (½ cup) plain flour and stir until combined. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2620361/photos/large/136257_2-d7313594cd6ab8050eb5593fe50c9039.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake rosti: Spoon the haloumi mixture into the baking dish, then use the back of the spoon to spread evenly and flatten the surface. Bake on the upper oven shelf for 30 mins or until golden and the haloumi is melted.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2620362/photos/large/136257_3-df5e843dd72013faeeefa3e05151e564.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make sweet chilli mayo: Meanwhile, combine the sweet chilli sauce (see Make it milder) and 2 tbs mayonnaise in a bowl and season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2620363/photos/large/136257_4-a62d949b6d8070fed34f10fd41d68227.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make salad and serve up: Cut the tomato into thin wedges. Combine 2 tsp olive oil and 1 tsp white wine vinegar in a large bowl and season with salt and pepper. Add the tomato and rocket and toss to coat. Serve the rosti at the table with the rocket salad and sweet chilli mayo. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2620364/photos/large/136257_5-6d8cd605fcdd62bb40522cc674798f78.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it milder: The sweet chilli sauce has a very mild chilli kick. We've suggested this amount for flavour but if you prefer less heat, reduce to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2620365/photos/large/136257_6-d0f7eaf992dd27c8f62b98925f51b538.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
